-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",185,{
[5889]="700515FB\n1\tSend goblin-gourds flying in Wistmead (total: 6)\tGoblin-gourds can be found throughout Wistmead. Halinard Bunce has helped carve a number of spooky goblin-gourds for the Harvest Festival. You should participate in the spirit of Bandobras Took and send the goblin-gourds flying!\n2\tTalk to Halinard Bunce\tHalinard Bunce can be found in Wistmead. You have sent a number of goblin-gourds flying in Wistmead and should now return to Halinard Bunce.\n",
[5890]="7001AF91\n1\tReturn to Graeme Tenderlarch at the Bree Town Hall\tGraeme Tenderlarch is at the Bree Town Hall. You received a post requesting that you meet with the Mayor of Bree, Graeme Tenderlarch.\n",
[5891]="70001884\n1\tFind Gatson at his farm\tGatson's Farm is south of Othrikar in the plains below the hills. Almost all of the farmers of the North Downs have abandoned their lands in the face of the Orc incursion. Hornbori learned that one, a man named Gatson, is refusing to leave, however. Hornbori has asked you to speak to Farmer Gatson about purchasing grain.\n",
[5892]="70001885\n1\tCollect stolen grain (total: 4)\tStolen sacks of grain can be found at Gurzlum, south-west of Gatson's Farm in the Kingsfell. You should recover stolen sacks of grain from Gurzlum.\n2\tBring the grain to Gatson\tGatson is at his farm in the Kingsfell, in the central North Downs. You should speak with Gatson at his farm.\n",
[5893]="70015E20\n1\tTalk to Faenhilith at Echad Eregion\tFaenhilith is at Echad Eregion, south-east of Gwingris. Lithuilas suggested that you journey to Echad Eregion and speak with Faenhilith.\n",
[5894]="70047BD3\n1\tTalk to Laeglaw at Tham Durlan\tLaeglaw can be found at Tham Durlan, due north of Haerondir in Dagorlad. Maendal has asked you to aid Laeglaw in his patrol of Dagorlad and his plans to act against the Orcs entrenched at Ondoher's Folly.\n2\tPatrol Ashtok to the north of Haerondir\tAshtok can be found just over the ridge to the north-east of Laeglaw in Dagorlad. Laeglaw has asked you to patrol Ashtok and learn what you can of the Orcs' purpose at Ondoher's Folly.\n3\tDefeat Orcs and search them for their orders\tAshtok can be found just over the ridge to the north-east of Laeglaw in Dagorlad. You have arrived at Ashtok and should now defeat Orcs and discover if any of them are bearing orders from the Enemy.\n4\tRead the smudged orders\tThe smudged orders can be found in your keeping. You have collected smudged orders from one of the Orcs you defeated and should now attempt to read them.\n5\tDeliver the orders to Laeglaw at Tham Durlan\tLaeglaw can be found due north of Haerondir at Tham Durlan. You have discovered the Orcs' troubling orders, and should now bring them to Laeglaw.\n6\tTalk to Mincham at Tham Durlan\tMincham can be found at Tham Durlan, near to Laeglaw. You have retrieved the Orcs' orders, but a curious phrase in the Black Speech of the Orcs has left Laeglaw vexed. He has asked you to have Mincham aid in its translation.\n",
[5895]="7000979C\n1\tMake rubbings of graves at Gorthost (total: 4)\tGorthost is by a collapsed wall in Parth Aduial, north of Ost Heryn and the road that runs east towards the Fields of Fornost. Forchon has sent you to the small graveyard at Gorthost to make rubbings of the stones there with charcoal and parchment. He bade you beware of the bats and barghests that surely prowl nearby.\n2\tTalk to Forchon\tForchon is at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, in Evendim. Ranger Forchon is waiting for you to return with the grave-rubbings you made at Gorthost.\n3\tPlace grave rubbings among the lineages\tThere is a book-shelf containing lineages at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, in Evendim. Forchon has asked you to file the grave-rubbings you made in the book-shelf containing lineages at the Ranger-camp on Tinnudir.\n4\tReturn charcoal and parchment to Forchon\tRanger Forchon is at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, in Evendim. Having filed the grave rubbings with the lineages, you should now return and speak with Forchon.\n",
[5896]="70067EEE\n1\tDeliver the goat fat to Kharishah at Rakhatâb\030Collect blobs of goat fat ([see journal]/10)\tGoats with thick layers of fat are found in the hills north or east of Rakhatâb. Goats from either location will do for the forge-master's needs. When you have collected the fat return to Kharishah in Rakhatâb.\n",
[5897]="7006E968\n1\tComplete Umbar or Ikorbân raids on the highest tier (total: 3)\tThe evils within The Depths of Mâkhda Khorbo and The Temple of Utug-bûr must be stopped. Complete three Umbar or Ikorbân raids on the highest tier.\n2\tReturn to the Temple of Utug-bûr Quartermaster\tReturn to the Temple of Utug-bûr Quartermaster with proof of your victory.\n",
[5898]="7002EAE8\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of Limlight Gorge.\n",
[5899]="7002EAEC\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of Limlight Gorge.\n",
[5900]="7002EAEA\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of Limlight Gorge.\n",
[5901]="7002EAEE\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred with Limlight Gorge.\n",
[5902]="7002EAE7\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Riders of Stangard.\n",
[5903]="7002EAEB\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of the Riders of Stangard.\n",
[5904]="7002EAED\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of the Riders of Stangard.\n",
[5905]="7002EAE9\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred of the Riders of Stangard.\n",
[5906]="70067C47\n1\tRead Keteph's letter\tKeteph is no longer within the outpost of Jax Phanâl. He hired an assistant to work in his place and has left you a letter to explain what transpired.\n",
[5907]="700169BD\n1\tDefeat gredbyg at the Chittering Hole (total: 10)\tThe gredbyg are stirring at the Chittering Hole, south-east of the Orc-watch. Auti is curious as to why so many gredbyg are gathering outside a door. He asked you to defeat several and see if the rest scatter or remain.\n2\tTalk to Auti at the Orc-watch\tAuti is at the Orc-watch, north-west of the Chittering Hole. Auti will be intrigued to hear that the gredbyg returned and defended the doors.\n",
[5908]="70032C26\n1\tDefeat grodbog-beetles (total: 7)\tThe grodbog-beetles are found throughout the grodbog hive, but seem to collect around the various ore deposits. Auti is curious as to why so many grodbog-beetles are gathering at the deposits. He asked you to defeat several and see if the rest scatter or remain.\n2\tReturn to Auti\tAuti is camped on the northern edge of the enormous grodbog hive. You should return to Auti with news of your success.\n",
[5909]="70032C37\n1\tDestroy the grodbog-larvae (total: 5)\tGrodbog-young may be found in the old barracks, inside the ancient dwarf-home of Nud-heden. You should destroy the grodbog-young in the ancient garrison of Nud-heden.\n2\tReturn to Kúli\tKúli is encamped with Auti just north of the grodbog hive. They will be pleased to know the grodbog-larvae are destroyed, and Nud-heden may some day be home to dwarves once more.\n",
[5910]="7006C97D\n1\tCollect sacks of dry river-bed dirt from the sediment (total: 4)\tGêna has asked you to go to the Usâl and fill four bags with soil from the dried river-bed.\n2\tBring the sacks of dirt to Gêna in Western Khanâg\tGêna has asked you to go to the Usâl and fill four sacks with soil from the dried river-bed. You have collected the soil and should bring it to Gêna in Western Khanâg.\n3\tBring water from the well for the newly planted seeds\tYou have collected the sediment Gêna asked for and delivered it to her. She will put it in the planter with the seeds while you get a bucket of water from the well.\n4\tTalk to Gêna\tThe planter has been filled with soil, seeded, and watered. You should talk to Gêna.\n",
[5911]="700529DC\n1\tDefeat Orcs and goblins in Shathur-munzu\t\n2\tDefeat Orcs and goblins in Shathur-munzu (total: 10)\tOrcs and goblins subservient to the wargs can be found inside Shathur-munzu. You should defeat any Orcs and goblins you find.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[5912]="70033333\n1\tJourney with Svanr to the Dimrill Dale\tSvanr is in the First Hall of Moria, in Nud-melek. You should speak with Svanr to travel into the Dale.\n2\tTalk to Svanr\tSvanr is at the First Hall of Moria. You should speak with Svanr.\n",
[5913]="700571E0\n1\tCollect Misty Meadow marigolds (total: 12)\tMountain flowers can be found west of Lyndelby. You should gather Misty Meadow marigolds for Badehild Bolga.\n2\tPlant flowers in planters (total: 12)\tPlanters can be found in Lyndelby. You should plant the flowers you collected.\n3\tTalk to Badehild Bolga in Lyndelby\tBadehild Bolga can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Badehild Bolga.\n",
[5914]="700571E7\n1\tFind and defeat the Misty Howler!\tThe Misty Howler can be found near Lyndelby. You should defeat the Misty Howler for Clodar Túcca.\n2\tTalk to Clodar Túcca in Lyndelby\tClodar Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Clodar Túcca.\n",
[5915]="700571EA\n1\tChickens can be found in Lyndelby. You should catch chickens for Erma Túcca.\t\n2\tTalk to Erma Túcca in Lyndelby\tErma Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should bring the chickens to Erma Túcca.\n",
[5916]="700571E4\n1\tHead to the Lyndelby gazebo\tThe gazebo can be found in the village centre. You should get on stage!\n2\tSing a song for the audience\030Perform at the Lyndelby gazebo\tThe gazebo can be found in the village centre. You should get on stage and sing!\n3\tTell a story to the audience\030Perform at the Lyndelby gazebo\tThe gazebo can be found in the village centre. You should get on stage and tell a story!\n4\tPerform a handstand for the audience\030Perform at the Lyndelby gazebo\tThe gazebo can be found in the village centre. You should get on stage and show off your strength!\n5\tTalk to Fastrada Túcca in Lyndelby\tFastrada Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Fastrada Túcca.\n",
[5917]="700571E3\n1\tPick up the pie from the table\tA freshly baked pie can be found in Lyndelby. You should deliver the pie to Madelgard Túcca.\n2\tPick up the pie from the table\tA freshly baked pie can be found in Lyndelby. You should deliver the pie to Ogiva Túcca.\n3\tPick up the pie from the table\tA freshly baked pie can be found in Lyndelby. You should deliver the pie to Erma Túcca.\n4\tTalk to Gísla Bolga in Lyndelby\tGísla Bolga can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Gísla Bolga.\n",
[5918]="700571ED\n1\tTry the Lyndelby Northern Leaf\tA barrel of Lyndelby Northern Leaf can be found in Lyndelby. You should try the Lyndelby Northern Leaf.\n2\tTry Hubo's Berry-bear\tA barrel of Hubo's Berry-bear can be found in Lyndelby. You should try Hubo's Berry-bear.\n3\tTry some Old Eagle Wings\tA barrel of Old Eagle Wings can be found in Lyndelby. You should try Old Eagle Wings.\n4\tTalk to Heldric Túcca in Lyndelby\tHeldric Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Heldric Túcca.\n",
[5919]="700571EC\n1\tGather Misty Mountain gems (total: 10)\tVeins of gems can be found near Lyndelby. You should gather the gems for Húbald Túcca.\n2\tSmooth down the gems on a grindstone\tA grindstone can be found in Lyndelby. You should smooth down the gems you gathered.\n3\tPlace the smoothed gems in the empty barrel\tThe tribute barrel can be found in Lyndelby. You should place the smoothed gems in the barrel for Húbald Túcca.\n4\tPick up the tribute barrel\tThe tribute barrel can be found in Lyndelby. You should pick up the barrel.\n5\tTake the barrel to Tribute Rock\tThe tribute spot can be found west of Lyndelby. You should place the tribute barrel at the tribute spot.\n6\tGreet Landroval with a bow\tLandroval can be found at the tribute spot. You should greet Landroval.\n7\tTalk to Landroval\tLandroval can be found at the tribute spot. You should talk to Landroval.\n8\tTalk to Húbald Túcca in Lyndelby\tHúbald Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Húbald Túcca.\n",
[5920]="700571E6\n1\tCollect frogs for Odger Túcca (total: 8)\tFrogs can be found in Lyndelby. You should collect frogs for Odger Túcca.\n2\tBring Odger Túcca the frogs you collected\tOdger Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should bring Odger Túcca the frogs that you collected.\n",
})
